{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1460,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:214f609849c10ac131e4f790",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得确认一下舞步才行。\n……因为偶尔，会不小心搞砸呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e113a14ab27114e37cc10955ec69ca39397f274eb92b36aca4c78b11db1862b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4253a8db8261dd7154acd29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对不放弃，绝不妥协！\n穿上这身衣服，我就会更加打起精神！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a813253e19893dd7f224d5b763c97849b07e62eabc087adc54dfb34544771c14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0240d6957c6d7b3244d17a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是大海还是比赛，我都要拿第一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8173d1aa6365dce97c35ccab595ba783191a8753a3a7323f5537b564e47888b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b5b0ea0798fefbbf9d9f567",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，喝杯杨枝甘露休息一下吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11fc62852700a762b927db3c2570d4f51edb740d291d8d63e261604f380106d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ffe6bb7733cdfc9b320b158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个设计也很好呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "746c87498be57cad88dfd42982483505e4a8fc68590645092815d5c80c6cab02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c166b9e75e98b8364537e234",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜欢的衣服\n越来越多了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29b8413d2a259a1de043e34be7cac7ff7eae622c98cada2e861be28e666496aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f830e67a1cdb15b25f5a51bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了能随时应对他人的目光，\n我彻底做好了仪容管理。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3178534c55fc7fbc4a8086a37a14057cdbaf3ccb6fdb43e3aee937da466e6579",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "71020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0eb95db23419bb01da634a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "饰品是母亲帮我选的。\n说是为了增添一份华丽感呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4df1242b6fe734c3f0bc6a7263ea0ed2d7f20cd44654edd7bfcbf4f106fad8b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "71021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:008d03ae76620590d822cabc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e503b927e22ca6e78ff3af1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我接受挑战！\n为了能互相切磋琢磨，\n一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e31fcc89249e7df58f8295b3ea9c2aecc690489d8b26fb63535ad5282a95bc89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04b293ffabd67358c361f725",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真厉害呢……！\n我也得拿出更多实力才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c14e5610ef946215f7efddfe10334f8351acb7f0c4f2a5a28943d6cdfb83ad9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31dcebeb7a553bf6cd90575d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！新的一天开始了！\n我们要挑战什么样的课题呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0df53d111609f051394e08c0601ecdc6f8b80e2d8718690749aa340c7c55479b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b1512ee157f735f9d525322",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放小姐即使是刚起床\n头发也顺滑得不得了呢……\n这也是与生俱来的才能吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa38f3b5459283a02cb82a1a90768249cf3392cf96a637d35cc6a3f429920a90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f68cf9c39d945c445f49e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会先处理好训练的准备工作。\n不用急，休息结束之后\n再叫我一声就好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db37806947a159d60f28f996ad53a5c538411f5708c04dddce5f32e55dbd5692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79825704b824c352aeb0e93a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "表情不错嘛。是想到了\n什么绝妙的主意了吗？\n方便的话，要不要跟我说说？",
      "source_fingerprint": "056a4f0f25a735a0ba468077c31a0cc5aa7cad6e60d1f371721b9c8f81b919a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b85a2335b2d5adc59e428ba8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "努力到这么晚啊。\n我也能在旁边一起工作吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c990465e1a9d791ccba97604bf634b5d8952815dde2e39d7b02546a8e24c708d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e924255914a81a17fff2977",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，\n今天的新闻确认完毕！\n真期待明天会发生什么呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a546addb499052feea98847ac39ef45b1808da9973ba0ed800e4617246d4b7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0679131c476bb80aba27b5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看着花朵时，仿佛听到了\n万籁争鸣小姐的音乐。心情\n变得非常华丽且愉快了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c85248619a466f102d519998ac5246621fbc2657cb4c71fa1f5189e42c7b6973",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6f22f63f916e2d21e0fd73c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "预报有雨？很有这个季节的风格\n不是挺好吗。我也只要以我的风格\n去面对就好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c00ef779993d3fe394828757e34a63f4ab92f9e15d926c54d423ca01f1587fa1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9119d0e02f5bc52964b4dd94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我应该很擅长自我管理才对……！无论\n有怎样的甜美诱惑，唯独体重\n我一定会控制住的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1974814b368d07f787c7562b4d7600b07c980ece00271ceecb718ad7485fa172",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e26b42b8d5121e6c1e6f033",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使寒冷，强击也很有精神呢。\n只是看着她，这边的心情\n也会变得明亮起来呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "17f8d046787e30f57ffb0204307bfb6e794b591bcabfdf2b5eb633bc8fffe14f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d20a4153262f8420258ae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的叫醒服务怎么样？\n用小铜锣铛地一声！……这种♪\n姐姐也评价说一发就能叫醒哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94915a3ab371f4b040ed5c46a4d5193fc6a3d8259f24389317e43c76a1a03060",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4c64d870daac91025a1c547",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Good morning……啊，早晨！\n……不是啦，是早上好！\n啊哈哈，刚睡醒的时候有点混乱呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79d6aa5b92cc89bde00fdcb5131a4379f7d8d6972230e20a6f7d81f829a043ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:592c77faecf974fccc25830f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在正是关键时刻哦。\n有没有人想喝作为努力奖赏的\n高级热带饮料！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93194876b392b4f72aaaa44bad4871e4269a82524980630bcff202f1795361f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44f1362e024f9974a60ff6f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小测验里出了没修读过的内容，\n但对我来说并无大碍。\n靠基础的应用与预习就能完美回答！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7535cec06fb13a0369b07c21bce1934ceb3a716829f0800f827f9602300bead",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5872b13d1679540ec7b0ebd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从高尚那里收到了贝壳哦。\n它就像赠予者一样，奏响着\n温柔的海浪声……呵呵，感觉能睡个好觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c60b2e0c3a14426b6dd1d3f3c3a7246f1dbb7d07aaa9f2c6b079f594eff2b4c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f657be00fb0aefc9dc1f2201",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，已经是休息时间了呢。\n要确认一下明天的行程吗？\n我会泡杯温热的奶茶哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aef045f96767ebb1884b22f2ae4e410d5c7019de796ab91d4554687aecfacda6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a394d59c944c71bf66e174",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以帮你选一套适合你的泳装吗？\n从现在起就融入流行趋势，\n尽情享受即将到来的假期吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "639ee2b9786c525b0c5c6cf2385cc373d9cb485dd34b610ab5280a3bcad29bd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:336c0e131a5364643402142e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "周末计划去度假胜地视察呢。\n……如果可以的话，愿意陪我一起去吗？\n毕竟你的意见总是能直击本质。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0a9bd92f3f99f74ea36bfcbe0fdab1510324687f0feb8f1b9dbdc004e02583",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf7540cf89fe823ee34b510",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "香港现在是干季，正是旅行的好时机！\n不想看看价值百万美金的夜景吗？\n导游……当然是我咯♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc605f9ea63e34b4cb4996c3356f577c2665bf68522b8cf5f0d4810bcae398ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60a7f30bc13554c476018794",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放同学，训练又要\n弄到很晚吧。\n必须得提前帮她把房间暖好才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c2d70af34941e9f727dd57082b90b8a1e85656029212d2f31807370bc710661",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53547cea7aea5bf8e4bf4217",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c7ae64cd113e38c89d8f44e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84545e9d062a703e60cf0240a4c6690b3f86c69931c0b8d072086c92aed0b29d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edc22787506ec0df54d77c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与光钻之间，即使互不言语\n也能心领神会。……因为我们要追求的\n目标非常相似。",
      "source_fingerprint": "158cdeeae7cc328377d99cd7090827b03e0c48a72ae7c1048b1a72230f4b02a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee6ac1dc20f922dd1fc78021",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家人们最棒的地方就是大家的生活都\n很充实。所以我也想\n在任何事情上都全力以赴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "227e5c0a14d569d61f8126f90b9647eae2935e7c590b9f00d890b81ab643fb2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8573780f7eb2f47de918b914",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到高尚，就会不由自主地\n想去搭话呢。\n待在一起感觉很舒服♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "91dc629d314369c2705ec19892e08e908ed8281f4f60b561eb80ed5e82f2522f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2320849fe6e5f5a26e2fbc0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很擅长弹键盘哦♪用多样的音色\n奏出旋律的那种感觉……\n有着其他地方无法体会的充实感！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fceacf55b77aeb32aa3485b77290f234dfed51ab0c94d666d80df16c8e408d00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72966b1ea1510021b81d0a0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和光钻在一起时的小北，\n感觉比平时更有热情……\n总觉得看起来大了一圈呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a1cb3952f06f4f9dc50e41a1427ff2b28e545e86e1574ec003ae8f4f51c0705",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf6c6cb0a2a5b34dd9b2df2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清爽且华丽。无论是作为运动员\n还是作为表演者，都能大放异彩的服装呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72cb9c5757cf672125eaee5e0c6ae52595d9667cebf3e90cb716006ea93401da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c33f138eada0cee0a745cc5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服的厂商，是怎么做到\n和学园合作的呢……\n果然是靠脚踏实地的营业活动吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e1b6f8259f4e3f1ca5da1253686509c630c43f5c2f8085326038463e9977899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb001bacde41b1af7052a836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是寄托了对比赛的认真态度的\n决胜服！我要优雅且\n稳健地夺取胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "652f0624e0a80344f4d3da1abc921835eb008aa14b032ac6b3b519cb1e958437",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3d52af4f237555683faaa21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和设计一样，我也很重视\n跑起来是否方便。\n如果赢不了，那不就没有意义了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "039630ca6237c07c05e9f7920a6806be9da59338a91be5ed894d4452abbd2fc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab78fbb49040558bf61a6d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是平时还是假日，起床时间\n我都保持一致。\n为了维持身体状态呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03709db6f8bebbd9ed25b7d07afc5344689fa52eb473bcd614f35e8bb44fe356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed34372e87fd8ead3944e090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从香港买了新的茶叶回来。\n休息时要不要一起喝点？\n想跟你分享一下感想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f05d6a138fc2fcd91fcffef3d88b98810ef9bccb9db01bf0f65ac260e50e6b6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9128285019cb6a04d1c4804",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回去之后真想好好泡个澡啊～……！\n身体放松下来的那一瞬间，\n真是让人欲罢不能呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9774bba926fa99b90e7ac2aba7826a4c75d64394d2688a369de39bbc340f03a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62c88ffe49c6cba487dd8a9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最喜欢这个季节了！\n因为这是许多新事物诞生、\n希望膨胀的时期呀♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "deaa33178587d383cb6c93aa60affda060fa75262726d8d5ffb74cf703b0ad52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f464487169c6bf2758337f56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有在涂防晒霜吗？\n考虑到未来的体质，\n从现在开始采取对策是很重要的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b18de2b2c6220789b7fb1ae26c7f0dab49b0ed2ccee01d47e8871642b5633877",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b56c94ddf8fb703ae1c5472",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到变色的叶子，就能感受到\n时间的流逝呢……必须趁今年\n把要做的事记下来才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c1ca37d10fbf37b23f0d44f5204d424f268b39d50cf95091aa234e419123021",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:849cfea68a08cbcb40d00de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔……日本的冬天好冷啊……\n因为和香港完全不同，\n这种温差真叫人吃惊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b7cf7d3db5393376a0e5cd37721e947779d3567e93daa7c22db516d85c61c76",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f4212544a50db4712c90aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和芭蕾同学的VR走钢丝对决，\n完全赢不了！那种平衡感，\n总有一天我也要掌握它……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0d72e63176bc96023e132772b982be28baf348968b995fdabd734e5e59b40a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12390325e302ce5f551636fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放同学说听过香港流行乐……\n呜呜……我在房间里随口哼歌，\n被她听到了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6fd68b26f9286e7a78cbf6b2be995b97388e050b0ca40a36af6a0c2f38238c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09a3810ef64cc0e99bd2af1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次该给强击讲讲去哪个国家\n度假的事呢？看着她那\n亮晶晶的双眼，真是太可爱了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "35860c7e69852f84f081a2c64ad76aa45c198567b618684bf618f1a93106e9cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e53d0452c9a7a58632331ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果和重要的人去香港的海边，\n我推荐半月湾哦。\n呵呵，你想邀请的人是谁呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "76feb1c8724741886a5e2e16b1fa091d95cbeb9f82f49bb6b9063d1f88829396",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:816bee820412b62aaf58e1f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀，头上有东西……！\n原来只是花饰歪了吗――\n……咳，请把它忘了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a9c572186fdfbbd7a9e5b7a1c5d649b5638ed827d2ba3c30bed3f8012b4ffad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24ddfa72d7ca5275b16dd3a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起床整理完资料后，\n去泳池游了一会儿。真是个不错的\n一天开端！你也要试试吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad55c523e7051c2d326025c983805de7968eb41e1f90aeb0f6e63dd430e431f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5130cc33ffa13b38d6d6141",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "泳池训练也很不错呢。\n对提升力量和核心也非常有效。\n……才怪，我只是想进去玩♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8147c09071903ce7d17dad59f256fd2ddb71ec4605e84f8f2a7fa3ffccb9de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b64815b31253e306b627ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到洗澡时间就能听到\n小北的歌声。虽然听着很舒服，\n但……栗东宿舍，离得挺远的吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14150050014e1aa8bf5affadd84ecf61331a61adc49adcaa7b72f680d602564",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecec1f27d65ce919c475fddd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "香港已经是可以在海里游泳的季节了！\n小时候总是等不及，\n让游泳圈和期待一起膨胀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c94feddb23e21e21eed649cab0eca3dd412e3a275db831a679ac1b3c3838c2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dbc2f4fc66b489f07d85727",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没被暑气打倒吧？我用冷冻过的\n水果做了奶昔，这就\n给你拿过去。好啦，休息休息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a216d5017cfa29a4f39d987aa96a585508af0efa2d686121a909743953a02c3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f45afa68ebb5787df5250696",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "中秋节我会从名店订购超多月饼。\n呵呵，真想快点看到吃得很香的\n高尚啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed73936ba653cedb28471a7385165d81cc7b3de0869a9c3d34ca638483469da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ece82ba8a54b4a7303957910",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，还挺冷的呢。\n干脆去冬泳，以此来磨炼\n意志力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6e460f42bff5f54fa69fdbe57e5de75bfe6839160cd5e04f9e82cbd42871f8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bf224091effe1ff4a6f4e83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个花纹啊，是妈妈亲手缝制、\n爸爸深深迷恋上的设计哦。\n我也会让胜利女神为之倾倒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "18f4412a5748ddf969c0a7549edf90f1675046111582ac01cadd095dc92b7009",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9812a455d7bde629ba2cc3c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把草帽内侧改成防晒布料来\n遮光的方案，我可是推动通过了哦。\n这都要归功于精心准备的演示资料呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e9856e573d2a55bfa0d36065f976ac05fbd0d73f60f905cb3842ea4ee028e98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b204af9beb752cc428a015",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也要一往无前地\n全速迈进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca5dbf33d7e1f8df3d2b9e5f5459e678cbbb801d902a9de2225d6fc08b61728c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d101db5f53925153e43a1705",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66aed8ffea8497edd70d3d40d25d47f5df2a9a8c26d622b7d7ab9527445b85e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89967fab6e4dc02c9732ceac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不管出多少汗都能应对，\n我带了很多毛巾。尽情大干一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28adb5cbc46decc1812e253ee7edd76d7bd4808319ec6da4716f96492b271d9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f19ae631a86cc3eb5e23de8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "时间和体力都是有限的。\n必须好好控制节奏，\n一步步推进才行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "471c295d931d142c85381e21927c5c218ca082ffeb31980f1886867415a76ee3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b45857e8454130005e62890",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系的，准备工作已经——\n……等、啊！\n忘了带饮料了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b1047ed7b10dc9939295d251885e054f50f3c6b4f32b10af2af2615e9fd795",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc15ceefe84db4c470fb287",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我听听你的想法！\n我想把你的想法和我的主意结合起来，\n寻找一条更好的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5cfb7b206d3c9a85ece5be8b590d7ed67329e3c615de2e06cbcbc82d6f04436",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afde716f429b78ffd15acd78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有感到疲劳？要是为了配合我\n让你勉强自己的话就不好了，\n如果觉得吃力要立刻告诉我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62521b491e8b23308ba1d3892e448aff49d54479b60e9ed6cbefd8cc26cc155b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e8c39e984f7bb3237ac334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自从开始和你并肩而行，\n感觉各种事情都变得顺畅了……\n真的，你很可靠。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1369da5eba95e62ccfb3c004200877f400755bf0dc40d0e88d1a8e6eae972dfe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0acd9402f46dce8864d01f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～，好清新的空气……！\n感觉能比平时更加集中精神呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06152b166b973fe84c63be03816dd3b3d9fbc274f2a5900363ca2b9c9095d6e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8808426031ff7f05696387d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天是要进行高强度训练吗？\n太棒了！\n就算是惊涛骇浪我也能驾驭自如！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3cf54514bd1391839d3519c79338bc7dae89dd97e9c48b7f0a1e913cf50be78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4602cbdea49cdfbef67ec766",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "简直每天都想约芭蕾同学去喝早茶。\n跟着她学了柔韧体操后，\n身体都变轻了！怎么谢都谢不够呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "551ac5128777610d19f3eebb2af96bbf27acda1748141cceda23ecd53f26ff8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a4a36199b89525a7befe606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "至今我还有那些会激励我说“唔好输呀！”的\n国际学校时期的伙伴们。\n……我必须得用结果来回应他们呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e8526ac64506793ccaa71f402c232f0fa28b8cfb739d17f9a3d15a5cb9fdec3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817007cae31e610e19e37d8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把泥地训练想象成在沙滩度假，\n用这种心态进行心理调适。\n这就是积极面对辛苦训练的秘诀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8e3c338db3f3c49c5b8e829e734723ea2656f234cb86dbc8dcb17abe0094ac8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95c9ec64348a8989baa2f50e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能尽情享受假期，多亏了你\n每天的支持。好多谢你！\n……我的心意，传达到了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fad5e3422c7c6cf7378ae2dae7b4bd148300bcb108c402471a0506fa9fe9da2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2f364126dc899f2fb9dffba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很擅长制定时间表哦。\n为了回报你的付出，我会好好\n规划一场假期的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c31366f70c2208419bb1cf168aacfadefa187c8fcf442d4eb6a934ea0d627ba2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fac63545e4e42238a37b00db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我做了一个梦，梦见和你一起\n眺望南海，为胜利干杯。\n我们俩一定要让它成真哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5631c04c052bf59378823c5d15928136c81e907b737bc96f88a7e1acd824743",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8295efffe580e3704e6e2932",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这份荣冠，是我们两个人的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15bf45aae4f3c2c1cbbc17cf7f89eea7dcdde88a9e1231d6a02fe278d4317b7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1088",
        "93000"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
